# Build output + vendored binaries (re-fetch with tools/fetch-sparkle.sh)
build/
*.app
vendor/
dist/

# Secrets — NEVER commit (Sparkle private-key export, signing certs)
*private_key*
*.p12

# Private working docs — business strategy / enrollment notes stay OUT of the public repo
PLAN.md
docs/

.DS_Store

# Design: the GENERATOR is committed, the rendered sheets are not — they are
# derived output, regenerable in one command, and would churn the diff. The
# source is kept precisely because the current icon's own header refers to
# "concept 3" and concepts 1 and 2 exist nowhere.
design/*.png
